/// `Echo` from `server_test.exs`: `handleConnection:` blocks reading one
/// packet, echoes it and closes.
Handler subclass: BlockingEcho

  handleConnection: sock :: Socket state: st :: Object -> HandlerResult =>
    received := sock recv
    received isOk ifTrue: [sock send: received value]
    HandlerResult close: st
